# The removal manifest: every path the fork doesn't carry.
#
# gitignore syntax, read by .fork/sync.py, with one difference: a negation can
# re-include a file under a directory an earlier pattern removed. The last
# pattern that matches a path decides.
#
# The rationale lives in the tracker: removal inventory (#2), Java/JNI (#3),
# codegen (#4), vendored libraries (#12), SystemCore (#13) and the Iota HAL
# backend seam (iota-robot map). The repo-wide cleanup patterns come last so
# they also apply inside every directory re-included above them.

# --- Vendored third-party libraries (#12) ------------------------------------
# Vendor nothing: every vendored library is fetched stock by the provider.

**/thirdparty/*/

# Carried libraries: WPILib-owned code, kept as upstream has it.
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/llvm/
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/json/
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/sigslot/
!wpinet/src/main/native/thirdparty/tcpsockets/
!glass/src/lib/native/thirdparty/mrccomm/

# The imgui_suite fonts are committed generator output (#4, #12).
!thirdparty/imgui_suite/generate_fonts.sh
!thirdparty/imgui_suite/generated/

# TEMPORARY: vendored libraries that don't have a provider recipe yet. Each
# stock-library ticket deletes its own line here, and birth isn't done until
# this block is empty.
!apriltag/src/main/native/thirdparty/apriltag/
!benchmark/src/main/native/thirdparty/benchmark/
!thirdparty/catch2/
!thirdparty/imgui_suite/
!tools/wpical/src/main/native/thirdparty/libdogleg/
!tools/wpical/src/main/native/thirdparty/mrcal/
!tools/wpical/src/main/native/thirdparty/mrcal_java/
!wpimath/src/main/native/thirdparty/eigen/
!wpimath/src/main/native/thirdparty/gcem/
!wpimath/src/main/native/thirdparty/sleipnir/
!wpinet/src/main/native/thirdparty/ada/
!wpinet/src/main/native/thirdparty/libuv/
!wpinet/src/main/native/thirdparty/llhttp/
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/argparse/
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/debugging/
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/double-conversion/
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/htrie/
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/mpack/
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/nanopb/
!wpiutil/src/main/native/thirdparty/upb/
# END TEMPORARY

# upstream_utils/*.py stay as the pin source; their patches never apply.
/upstream_utils/*_patches/

